[2026-09-07T20:11:49.703671+00:00] [CHALLENGER] completed F7-T3b -> PASS WITH CONCERNS. All 3 F7-T3b acceptance criteria pass (check_loops clean, --strict clean, pytest 181 passed). Findings: (1) threading.Timer + queue.Queue timeout path works, timer cancelled in finally on success, FlightServerError message includes timeout seconds, no LIMIT injection in do_get. (2) ServerConfig.query_timeout_seconds lacks a bool validator; Pydantic lax mode coerces YAML 'true' to 1 — flight_server.py defensively falls back to 120, but config model is inconsistent with flight_port validator. (3) _validate_select_only is prefix-only: false positives on leading comments, false negatives on 'WITH ... DELETE' or multi-statement queries; read-only DuckDB cursor/connection still blocks writes, so non-blocking. (4) threading.Timer cannot abort an in-flight DuckDB query; the worker daemon may continue running after timeout, a resource-leak concern under load.
